  "details": "Hi I need help with this problem so I have been playing VRChat for a while now and this just has just popped up I went to go hang out with a friend in a world but for some reason, she couldn't see or hear me even though we were in the same instance to her but I could see her but not hear her in the first world we were in but then when I went to another instance and they just disappeared we didn't have each other blocked so it was quite strange we usually hang out on a weekly/daily basis, we thought that unfriending each other and adding each other back might trigger and do something thing but it still didn't work, I would like to know if this is a problem that has happened to other people or it's just happening to me, the help will be highly appreciated.",
